---LINES
var     = ipv   -       -       -       -         "0.98beta"
alt1    = ipa   -       -       -       -         "YES"
alt2    = ipa   -       -       -       -         "[x]"
mse     = ipm   -       -       -       -         " End of work "
---#sp      = h     "space "
sp      = iv    -       -       -       -     "[space]"


---SCREEN                                     
=LINLIB/VISI - screen library/toolkit
 LINLIB/VISI          |
 1986-1990 (c)        |line control on navigation context:
                      | ."line type". ."visual"......  ."key".  ."action".....  
                      |                                                         
common keys:          | menu item:   .mse............  .:SP...  select          
                      |                                .:NL...  select optional         
 .:HE... get help     |                                                         
 .:EX... exit page    | selector:         .alt2.       .:SP...  toggle forward  
 .:RE... refresh page |                                .:DE...  toggle backward 
                      |                                                         
line-depended keys:   | variable:       .var.....      .:SP...  keep content    
                      |                                .:DE...  erase           
 .:SP... select,next  |line editing context:                                         
 .:DE... delete,prev  |  ."key". ."action".............. ."alternative"...      
 .:CA... cancel       |  .:NL... commit changes                                 
                      |  .:KI... Ins/Ovr mode            .:PR... .:PR...        
optional keys:        |  .:DE... erase left from cursor                         
 .:TA...    .:KH...   |  .:KD... erase below cursor                             
 .:KD...    .:KE...   |                  erase up to end .:PR... .:SP...        
 .:KI...    .:PU...   |  .:KH... jump to 1st symbol      .:PR... .:AL...        
            .:PD...   |  .:KE... jump to end of text     .:PR... .:AR...        
                      |
---END


."control keys:"..................     
 - select menu item:       .:SP...     
 - start line editing:                 
     * keep content        .:SP...     
     * clear before edit   .:DE...     
 - selector cycle/toggle:              
              * forward    .:SP...     
              * backward   .:DE...     

 ."all page control keys"................

 - Get help                .:HE...
 - Exit, end of the page   .:EX...
 - Refresh screen          .:RE...
 
 - Page context navigation:   
   * to next line:       .:TA... 
   * arrow keys, 
   .:KH... .:KE... .:PU... .:PD...
       









   ."line types".................
 
   .var....... - editable string
   .alt2.         - selector
   .mse............ - menu item
 
  - Get help                .:HE...
  - Exit, end of the page   .:EX...
  - Refresh screen          .:RE...
 
 - Move to next line.... .:TA... 
 - Navigation:
 .:AU... .:AD... .:AL... .:AR... 
